# Windows Ardia skeleton series for Chromium 157 plus helium-windows.
# The order Ardia's changes go into the Chromium tree (docs/engine-build.md > "The patch series").
# Delta from series: eight macOS-only patches are omitted: devtools-redock-display, safe-storage-name,
# safe-storage-no-silent-reset, video-super-resolution, keep-old-frame-on-swap, angle-metal-shader-cache,
# background-instance-no-default-handlers and apple-passwords-host-skipped.
# video-super-resolution is replaced by a .win variant retaining its nine portable, macOS-gated compositor files.
# helium-branding, cef-carryover and window-hosted also use .win variants without their Mac-only or embedder-only hunks.
# chromium <patch> applies to chromium/src; layer <dir> runs <dir>/apply.sh, which delegates to apply-win.sh.
# The Windows layers replace engine/chromium and engine/ardiacore at the same two layer positions.

